{"id":"3b9475fbc2cb8d8a","group":"88","path":"88/88-prop-ce-semi-decidable.md","title":"CE is Semi-decidable","display":"prop-ce-semi-decidable — CE is Semi-decidable","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-prop-ce-semi-decidable","aliases":["88-prop-ce-semi-decidable"],"display":"prop-ce-semi-decidable — CE is Semi-decidable","depends_on":["[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-accept]]","[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-prop-ce-semi-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-prop-ce-semi-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-ce-semi-decidable — CE is Semi-decidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c639e2083bc9b76\" href=\"?note=6c639e2083bc9b76\" title=\"88-df-tm-accept\">88-df-tm-accept</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set of natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably-enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing machine)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)\\)</span> (acceptance predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6c639e2083bc9b76\" href=\"?note=6c639e2083bc9b76\" title=\"88-df-tm-accept\">88-df-tm-accept</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> (binary input encoding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ce\\text{-}semi\\text{-}decidable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\nx\\in A\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ce\\text{-}semi\\text{-}decidable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\nx\\in A\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>机器接受的是编码后的单个输入，不是把集合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>本身作为输入。</li>\n<li>CE集等价于半可判定集</li>\n<li>停机则接受，否则可能不停机</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-accept","status":"resolved","id":"6c639e2083bc9b76","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-accept]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(A)$ (computably-enumerable predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-accept","status":"resolved","id":"6c639e2083bc9b76","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)$ (acceptance predicate, see [[88-df-tm-accept]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$ (binary input encoding, see [[88-df-encoding]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":f